# Robigo's test of the two keywords no shipped chapter uses, MET_PEOPLE_AMOUNT and
# MET_CLEAR_ACT_EVENTS, played on the first Roman chapter's map by the computer in player 0's
# seat (crates/s2-sim/tests/missions.rs).
